summary:
  A device that refused one station keeps its warning while the next
  station is offered to it, and after it took that one.

history:
  The mark on a device's row is about the station it was last asked to
  play. The Ruark that refused three addresses played a fourth
  (2026-11-12): with the mark left standing, its row would say "Cannot
  play this station" over a station it plays.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CastLogic.js

find:
      s.pending[uuid] = seq;
      delete s.on[uuid];
      delete s.refused[uuid];

replace:
      s.pending[uuid] = seq;
      delete s.on[uuid];

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_castlogic.qml::test_a_device_that_refused_is_marked_until_it_is_asked_again_or_leaves.
